{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"bfb0c87a087f143d5d4fb3c3b303347e581f98d0"},"timestamp":1516848403,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyOTE0MzIzNjc=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/2100","origin":"github"},"title":"rerun --message to become a \"format\" template","message":"Originally came up in https://github.com/datalad/datalad/pull/2076#discussion_r163448394\n\nATM it would be the same message for all reran commits which is kinda boring. It would be nice it it provided a way to template it while providing possibly useful information as dict for its formatting\n- author -- author of original commit\n- date -- date of the previous commit\n- commit -- hexsha of the reran commit\n- message -- previous commit message ful\n- message-plain -- message with RUN json portion stripped out\n\nThen I could do something like `--message={message-plain}\\n This commit was a reran of the original one by {author} on {date}`","files":null}]}